          {
            "msg_id": "M28",
            "speaker_id": 109283,
            "reply_to": "M27",
            "text": "Decision: Deeper mechanical checks, such as specific fluid levels and brake wear, are confirmed to be part of the separate weekly deep-check routine (T2).",
            "mentions": [],
