      {
        "thread_id": "TH3",
        "thread_goal": "Agree on hazardous substances handling rules and workshop standards",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M39",
            "speaker_id": 109283,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi all, let's talk about T3 and T9 - hazardous materials and workshop organization. To get started, I've drafted an outline for the 'Hazardous Substances Handling and Storage Guide' (A2). My main points are: all chemicals and oils must be stored in the designated yellow cabinet, spill kits must be kept stocked and accessible by the main door, and correct PPE is mandatory when handling any of these substances.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T3",
              "T9",
              "A2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "warning",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M40",
            "speaker_id": 38857,
            "reply_to": "M39",
            "text": "What about old truck batteries? They're just stacked in the corner right now. Where should they go?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M41",
            "speaker_id": 109283,
            "reply_to": "M40",
            "text": "Good question. They are hazardous. They need to be on the designated pallet for specialist collection. I'll add a section on battery handling to the guide A2.",
            "mentions": [
              38857
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M42",
            "speaker_id": 156061,
            "reply_to": "M41",
            "text": "We should also think about workshop zones for T9. At my last place, we had a 'dirty zone' for stripping engines and a 'clean zone' for assembly. It helped prevent cross-contamination of parts and kept the main area safer. We could mark the floor with tape.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T9"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "lightbulb",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M43",
            "speaker_id": 203126,
            "reply_to": "M42",
            "text": "So for the end-of-shift cleaning, what does that actually mean? Does my whole bay need to be spotless?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M44",
            "speaker_id": 108987,
            "reply_to": "M43",
            "text": "It means all your tools are back on the shadow board, the floor in your bay is swept, and any waste oil or parts are in the correct disposal bins. We can create a simple checklist for it. I can draft the 'Workshop Cleaning and Tool Storage Standard' (A6) based on this discussion.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A6"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "broom",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M45",
            "speaker_id": 109283,
            "reply_to": "M44",
            "text": "That's a great idea, a checklist makes it clear for everyone. Let's formalize these points so we can move forward.",
            "mentions": [
              108987
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M46",
            "speaker_id": 109283,
            "reply_to": "M45",
            "text": "Decision: The hazardous substances rules (A2) are approved. This includes mandatory storage in labeled cabinets, accessible spill kits, correct PPE, and a dedicated area for used batteries.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D5"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M47",
            "speaker_id": 109283,
            "reply_to": "M46",
            "text": "Decision: The end-of-shift standards (A6) are agreed. This will include defined 'clean' and 'dirty' work zones and a standard checklist for tool storage and bay cleaning.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A6"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D6"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M48",
            "speaker_id": 156061,
            "reply_to": "M47",
            "text": "This will make a big difference. Good for safety and efficiency.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M49",
            "speaker_id": 38857,
            "reply_to": "M47",
            "text": "Ok, clear.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M50",
            "speaker_id": 108987,
            "reply_to": "M47",
            "text": "I'll get that A6 draft ready by tomorrow.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A6"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M51",
            "speaker_id": 203126,
            "reply_to": "M47",
            "text": "The checklist will be helpful.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
